# Optional API origin for the enrichment service, baked in at build time.
#
# Leave unset for local development (Vite proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8000) and
# when FastAPI serves the built bundle itself — requests stay same-origin.
#
# When the frontend is hosted separately from the API (Vercel + Render), set it
# to the hosted API origin, without a trailing slash:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://unilog-enrichment-api.onrender.com
